  |  |  ------------------
  |  |  |  Branch (66:9): [True: 31.2k, False: 0]
  |  |  ------------------
  |  |   67|  31.2k|        /* If expr evaluates to 0, we have two case labels "0", which is illegal. */ \
  |  |   68|  31.2k|        case /* ERROR: static assertion failed */ (expr): \
  |  |  ------------------
  |  |  |  Branch (68:9): [True: 0, False: 31.2k]
  |  |  ------------------
  |  |   69|  31.2k|        ; \
  |  |   70|  31.2k|    } \
  |  |   71|  31.2k|} while(0)
  |  |  ------------------
  |  |  |  Branch (71:9): [Folded, False: 31.2k]
  |  |  ------------------
  ------------------
